"""
Week 3 Task: Unsupervised Learning and Clustering Analysis
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Objective:
    Apply clustering (unsupervised learning) to a publicly available
    dataset in order to segment it into meaningful groups, and
    analyze the characteristics of each resulting cluster.

Dataset:
    Titanic passenger dataset (same public dataset used in the
    Week 1 and Week 2 tasks).
    Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/datasciencedojo/datasets/master/titanic.csv

Algorithm:
    K-Means clustering (scikit-learn), with the number of clusters
    chosen using the elbow method on inertia.
"""

